---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-void-indigo text-sacred-white py-12 px-8 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-sanctuary-saffron rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">
          G
        </div>
        <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Gurudevi</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-silver-subtle text-sm max-w-xs">
        An Education Ecology Support System. Mending the teaching-learning impedance match through care and technology.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-temple-gold font-bold mb-4">Explore</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-silver-subtle">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">About the Ecology</a></li>
        <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="/support" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Support & Feedback</a></li>
        <li><a href="/delete-account" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Delete Account</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/thuthimal" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Thuthimal (Gratitude)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://platform.gurudevi.edlove.org" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Open Web Platform</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-temple-gold font-bold mb-4">Connect</h3>
      <p class="text-silver-subtle text-sm mb-4">
        Gurudevi lives inside the EdLove constellation. These are our official homes.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-silver-subtle text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://edlove.org" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">EdLove Foundation</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://intuitui.edlove.org" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">intuitui labs</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://neevsk.edlove.org" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Founder: Neevsk</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://platform.gurudevi.edlove.org" class="hover:text-sacred-white transition-colors">Gurudevi Platform (Web)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-sacred-white/10 mt-12 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-lg text-silver-subtle space-y-4 md:space-y-0 text-center md:text-left">
    <p>&copy; {currentYear} Gurudevi. Part of the <a href="https://edlove.org" class="text-sanctuary-saffron font-bold hover:text-temple-gold transition-colors">EdLove Constellation</a>.</p>
    <p class="tracking-wide">
      Handcrafted with 💖 by 
      <a href="https://intuitui.edlove.org" class="text-temple-gold hover:text-sanctuary-saffron transition-colors font-bold tracking-tighter lowercase">intuitui labs</a> 
      for the educational topology
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
